==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From ''[[leika]]'' meaning "to [[play]]" + the reflexive pronoun ''[[sér]]'', which is the dative form of ''[[sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".

===Verb===
{{head|is|verbs}}

# to [[play]]
#: {{ux|is|Börnin eru að '''leika sér'''.|The children are '''playing'''.}}
#: {{ux|is|Ég '''leik mér''' að bolta.|I '''play''' with a ball.}}